# carts/dialogue - walkthrough: read the scene to the end and take the FIRST answer
# ("Burn it all in the tower"), which finishes on the ending THE TOWER HELD.
#
#     quarp replay record carts/dialogue -o /tmp/w.qrpr --ticks 800 --input-file carts/dialogue/replays/walkthrough.input
#
# Grammar (quarp replay record --input-file): tick:buttons, entries separated by commas
# or newlines, '#' starts a comment. Buttons are L R U D O X S; every press is a *tap*
# (press on one tick, release on the next) because the cartridge reads Btnp - "pressed
# this tick and not the last" - and a held button would advance exactly one page and then
# sit there for the rest of the recording.
#
# The track is deliberately dumb: one X tap every 20 ticks and nothing else. Each tap
# either finishes typing the page it is looking at or turns to the next one, so the scene
# can only move forwards and the script does not have to know the page layout. That is why
# the move to 160x90 (ADR-021) cost this file nothing but its length: the same nine replies
# re-wrap from 26 to 34 columns and one playthrough shrinks from 21 windows to 18, and the
# only edit needed here was to stop 400 ticks earlier. The choice menu takes the same X to
# confirm, and with no Down ever pressed it confirms the option the cursor starts on: the
# first one.
#
# Timeline on 160x90, all of it read off the frame hash and not off the source (ticks are
# track-scale; the cartridge sees entry N on its own tick N+1): the first of 13 setup windows
# is up at tick 0, the 23rd tap opens the choice menu on tick 460, the tap on tick 480
# confirms the first option, and the tap on tick 660 closes the last window of the branch -
# from there on the screen is THE TOWER HELD and the frame hash never changes again, because
# an ending answers to nothing but Start. The remaining taps in this file are slack: they cost
# nothing and they keep the two tracks the same length.
20:X,21:,40:X,41:,60:X,61:,80:X,81:,
100:X,101:,120:X,121:,140:X,141:,160:X,161:,
180:X,181:,200:X,201:,220:X,221:,240:X,241:,
260:X,261:,280:X,281:,300:X,301:,320:X,321:,
340:X,341:,360:X,361:,380:X,381:,400:X,401:,
420:X,421:,440:X,441:,460:X,461:,480:X,481:,
500:X,501:,520:X,521:,540:X,541:,560:X,561:,
580:X,581:,600:X,601:,620:X,621:,640:X,641:,
660:X,661:,680:X,681:,700:X,701:,720:X,721:,
740:X,741:,760:X,761:,780:X,781:
